5\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $x$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509164 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509183} {:answer/id #uuid "a65b148e-ebaa-5313-b824-fd0cb34f8f6e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509183} :answer-field/id #uuid "89a51c62-b05a-540b-9e93-1b6230dda76a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509189} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5fd99a4-ddcf-55d1-9b15-5ac5dff61a43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509204} {:answer/id #uuid "d687931e-a29d-5efd-b673-e9deab3adf2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509215} {:answer/id #uuid "f4498730-43c5-503f-8dfb-ad2ab3b897e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509230} {:answer/id #uuid "f6ea7f1e-f6a3-55e0-89b8-23a9a14cd4a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509232}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f6ea7f1e-f6a3-55e0-89b8-23a9a14cd4a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509232} :answer-field/id #uuid "fcd64ba7-5484-592a-b858-d730e378e03f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509235}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5d211815-c8ae-5268-9f21-aa7a3a361a49" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{s + 5t = 8; -6s - 3t = -11$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $s$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $s$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $s$ in the first equation is $1$, while in the second equation it is $-6$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}6}$, then the coefficient of $s$ will turn into $6$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $-6$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\{(s + 5t = 8)\\cdot (6); -6s - 3t = -11\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $s$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n6s + 30t &= 48 \\\\\n-6s - 3t &= -11 \\\\\n(30t - 3t) &= (48 - 11) \\\\\n27t &= 37\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}6}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509176 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b6c98e2-b881-582d-9f5f-0b5e631af0d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509136} {:answer/id #uuid "41817a51-4551-5887-8edc-4f68222f6c52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509154}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41817a51-4551-5887-8edc-