n\\{(-2s + 10t = 5)\\cdot (-4); -8s - 2t = 10\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $s$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n8s - 40t &= -20 \\\\\n-8s - 2t &= 10 \\\\\n(-40t - 2t) &= (-20 + 10) \\\\\n-42t &= -10\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-4}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509203 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19a023a1-5637-52be-becc-94d44c704a36" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509134} {:answer/id #uuid "2d4852eb-b287-5edc-94bd-5d263ed7b246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509143} {:answer/id #uuid "5cdd9d3f-8d36-58b4-9886-ce4ee52ed524" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509163} {:answer/id #uuid "918562c7-6c5b-59ed-b9ef-27e37857cff7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509192}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5cdd9d3f-8d36-58b4-9886-ce4ee52ed524" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509163} :answer-field/id #uuid "1fcfd789-6eff-55ae-a24d-fb35b43117f1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509140} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6366cbf8-6f3c-59f8-85e8-afa222de7c79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509170} {:answer/id #uuid "e812bb9d-85bd-5eba-96a1-00f6dcc2114f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759