v = 8$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $u$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $u$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $u$ in the first equation is $8$, while in the second equation it is $-4$.\n\nIf we multiply the second equation by ${\\color{blue}2}$, then the coefficient of $u$ will turn into $-8$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $8$ in the first equation.\n\n$$\n\\{8u + 6v = 3; (-4u + 5v = 8)\\cdot (2)\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $u$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n8u + 6v &= 3 \\\\\n-8u + 10v &= 16 \\\\\n(6v + 10v) &= (3 + 16) \\\\\n16v &= 19\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509208 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65d8927d-3570-5e0f-a41d-d32ff6b3dcd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509173} {:answer/id #uuid "70f3e0b1-c6be-57d7-87be-d7c902df2b64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509179} {:answer/id #uuid "a3454e35-cf50-5bb3-b3bd-23345b63a1f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509198} {:answer/id #uuid "f1293e69-84d8-5ff5-8317-41a966b1f0f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509228}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f1293e69-84d8-5ff5-8317-41a966b1f0f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509228} :answer-field/id #uuid "