e, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}5}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509233 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04628238-d380-592d-b5b6-3c682a225f46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509124} {:answer/id #uuid "a87f090a-c78c-5737-88f2-7b5e3dfd3525" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a87f090a-c78c-5737-88f2-7b5e3dfd3525" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509202} :answer-field/id #uuid "8250c2eb-d7f6-5ac0-a534-35ae93df8f7e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509187} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bb4b0b3-7585-53b9-9698-315b218cf567" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509126} {:answer/id #uuid "3452e2e9-29bb-5de6-ac26-87db98641b6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509144} {:answer/id #uuid "3d80b461-5f25-562b-8ac3-2849bd730f2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509152} {:answer/id #uuid "56465b81-892c-5a5e-a9e1-a8f703c83857" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509160}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3452e2e9-29bb-5de6-ac26-87db98641b6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-